1. Purpose of the Software
PSN ID Finder is a Windows-based software project developed as a future-oriented tool intended to help users discover and analyze PlayStation Network Online IDs more efficiently and faster, for educational, research, and informational purposes only.

The project aims to simplify technical processes and reduce manual effort, contributing to better understanding of availability checks, automation concepts, and network-based ID validation workflows.

